@gateway = http://localhost:8080
@keycloak = http://127.0.0.1:8180
@customerSecret = local-demo-customer-secret
@otherSecret = local-demo-other-secret

### Token — customer (accounts read + transfers write)
# @name customerToken
POST {{keycloak}}/realms/banking/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id=customer-app&client_secret={{customerSecret}}&scope=ledger.accounts.read ledger.transfers.write

### Health is public
GET {{gateway}}/actuator/health

### Account read
GET {{gateway}}/api/ledger/accounts/acc-demo
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken.response.body.access_token}}

### Missing token
GET {{gateway}}/api/ledger/accounts/acc-demo

### Wrong audience
# @name otherToken
POST {{keycloak}}/realms/banking/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id=other-api-app&client_secret={{otherSecret}}&scope=ledger.accounts.read

###
GET {{gateway}}/api/ledger/accounts/acc-demo
Authorization: Bearer {{otherToken.response.body.access_token}}

### Transfer write (repeat to see 429)
POST {{gateway}}/api/ledger/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}

{}

### Slow GET (504; connection-reset retry is GatewayRetryIT)
GET {{gateway}}/api/ledger/accounts/acc-slow
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken.response.body.access_token}}

### Circuit feed (repeat ~8 times, then 503)
GET {{gateway}}/api/ledger/accounts/acc-down
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken.response.body.access_token}}

### Prometheus
GET {{gateway}}/actuator/prometheus
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken.response.body.access_token}}
